\title{Ben Davison：BPS Cohomology in Geometry and Representation Theory}
\date{2026-10-18}
\taxon{Reference}
\author{author}

\p{Ben Davison，BPS Cohomology in Geometry and Representation Theory，Proceedings of the International Congress of Mathematicians 2026，492–512。DOI：[10.1137/25M1810234](https://epubs.siam.org/doi/10.1137/25M1810234)。[官方正文](https://epubs.siam.org/doi/full/10.1137/25M1810234)于 2026 年 7 月 13 日在线发表；版权属 International Mathematical Union，按 [CC BY 4.0](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/) 许可发布。[arXiv 预印本 v1](https://arxiv.org/abs/2601.08004v1)提供版本化数学源文件。}
\p{Ben Davison、Sven Meinhardt，Cohomological Donaldson–Thomas theory of a quiver with potential and quantum enveloping algebras，Invent. Math. 221 (2020)，777–871；[arXiv:1601.02479v5](https://arxiv.org/abs/1601.02479v5)。Theorems A–C 给整性、墙穿越与 PBW；§1.6 明确额外交换符号及双线性扭转。}
\p{Ben Davison，The integrality conjecture and the cohomology of preprojective stacks；[arXiv:1602.02110v4](https://arxiv.org/abs/1602.02110v4)。Theorem A 给预投射叠 Borel–Moore 纯性；§3.1–3.4 给消失循环、降维与整性约定，§8.2 给 Kac 多项式比较。}
\p{Ben Davison、Lucien Hennecart、Sebastian Schlegel Mejia，BPS algebras and generalised Kac–Moody algebras from 2-Calabi–Yau categories；[arXiv:2303.12592v3](https://arxiv.org/abs/2303.12592v3)。§1.1–1.4 的生成层与主定理说明 BPS Lie 结构，预投射专门情形不要求原箭图对称。}
\p{Tommaso Maria Botta、Ben Davison，Okounkov's conjecture via BPS Lie algebras；[arXiv:2312.14008v2](https://arxiv.org/abs/2312.14008v2)。主定理及推论比较 Maulik–Okounkov Lie 代数、Yangian 正半部和预投射 CoHA。}
\p{Ben Davison，Nonabelian Hodge theory for stacks and a stacky P=W conjecture，Adv. Math. 415 (2023)，108889。官方报告 §5.4 引用此文精确定义叠反常滤过，并区分已证的粗模空间 P=W 与叠版本猜想。上述补充文献各自适用其版权与许可，主报告的 CC BY 许可不自动覆盖它们。}
